sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Third-Party Agent
    participant S as Claims MCP Server :3000
    participant U as Claims Mock API :4000

    P->>S: POST /mcp tools/call claims_create_claimant
    S->>U: POST /claimants (Bearer token)
    U-->>S: 201 Claimant {claimantId}
    S-->>P: structuredContent: Claimant

    P->>S: POST /mcp tools/call claims_check_policy_coverage
    S->>U: GET /policies/{policyNumber}/coverage-check
    U-->>S: 200 {covered, coverageLimit, estimatedPayout}
    S-->>P: structuredContent: CoverageCheckResult

    P->>S: POST /mcp tools/call claims_create_claim
    S->>U: POST /claims
    U-->>S: 201 Claim {status: submitted}
    S-->>P: structuredContent: Claim

    P->>S: POST /mcp tools/call claims_add_note
    S->>U: POST /claims/{claimId}/notes
    U-->>S: 201 Note
    S-->>P: structuredContent: Note

    P->>S: POST /mcp tools/call claims_transition_status (toStatus=under_review)
    S->>U: POST /claims/{claimId}/status
    U->>U: check isLegalTransition(submitted, under_review) -> true
    U-->>S: 200 Claim {status: under_review}
    S-->>P: structuredContent: Claim

    P->>S: POST /mcp tools/call claims_transition_status (toStatus=approved, approvedAmount)
    S->>U: POST /claims/{claimId}/status
    U->>U: check isLegalTransition(under_review, approved) -> true
    U-->>S: 200 Claim {status: approved, approvedAmount}
    S-->>P: structuredContent: Claim

    Note over P,U: Illegal-transition check (demo script step)
    P->>S: POST /mcp tools/call claims_transition_status (toStatus=under_review)
    S->>U: POST /claims/{claimId}/status
    U->>U: check isLegalTransition(approved, under_review) -> false
    U-->>S: 409 policy_violation
    S-->>P: isError: true

    P->>S: POST /mcp tools/call claims_create_payment (Idempotency-Key: k1)
    S->>U: POST /claims/{claimId}/payments (Idempotency-Key: k1)
    U->>U: claim.status == approved? emit StatusEvent(approved -> in_payment)
    U-->>S: 201 Payment {status: issued}
    S-->>P: structuredContent: Payment

    Note over P,U: Idempotent retry (same Idempotency-Key)
    P->>S: POST /mcp tools/call claims_create_payment (Idempotency-Key: k1)
    S->>U: POST /claims/{claimId}/payments (Idempotency-Key: k1)
    U-->>S: 201 same Payment (no second payment created)
    S-->>P: structuredContent: Payment (identical paymentId)
